    "body": "> Unfortunately, build.whatwg.org seems to be down at the moment (cc @domenic).\n\nYeah, I'd really like to reduce the moving parts here and not require me to maintain the build server in addition to the Travis server... maybe we should accept this for now, but I'm really not a big fan of having Travis subcontract some of its work out to another server.\n",
