    "body": "@annevk Yeah, already checked. However, Dockerfile of html-build needs to be modified in order to be used on Travis, as by default it installs & starts HTTP server additionally to build, even though we don't need that on CI.\n\nThe easiest way would be to resolve\n\n> We hope to in the future provide precompiled wattsi binaries, built via continuous integration, for Wattsi.\n\ngiven in Wattsi repo, but for now I guess we can go with external server and iteratively improve situation.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
