    "created_at": "2016-05-16T21:04:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-16T21:04:27Z",
    "body": "The other issue with the Docker approach is that if we just downloaded a version of the Dockerfile from html-build, it would simply rebuild Wattsi inside the container each time, which isn't what we want. We'd have to create a separate Dockerfile and upload the resulting container to the Docker Hub so that Travis could download it.\n\nHosted binaries does seem simpler.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
